// The same class method on a class with class state (row 3f, BT-4298). The
// method does not touch `calls`, but the class has class variables, so under
// ADR 0142 it keeps running in the class process: the control row.
Object subclass: VbStatefulMath
  classState: calls :: Integer = 0

  class double: x :: Integer -> Integer => x * 2
